ly have the data-protection keychain and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supply the access group implicitly — no extra entitlement is required."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Which-entitlement-for-privacy","type":"heading","text":"Which entitlement, for privacy","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Encryption, this-device-only accessibility, iCloud-sync exclusion, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"backup exclusion are identical whichever path you take — the access group"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only governs "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"which of your own apps"}]},{"type":"text","text":" can read an item, never third"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parties or the cloud. For app-private identifiers, in order of strictness:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Most private:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" a provisioning-profile–signed build with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"accessGroup: nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", relying on the implicit "},{"code":"application-identifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"group ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<TeamPrefix>.<bundle-id>"},{"type":"text","text":"). No other app — even one you sign"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"under the same team — can ever be entitled to it. Mirrors the iOS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default exactly; zero sharing surface."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Practically equivalent:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"keychain-access-groups"},{"type":"text","text":" array whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[